## 2. Helios-n facts (cite, do not invent)

From Helios § on resource trade-off / Helios-n:

- Partition decoding graph into sub-graphs; time-multiplex onto a fixed **lattice**.
- Physical PE stores/loads PE state from **local LUTRAM** (not BRAM — shallower depth); context switch ≈ **1 cycle**.
- Adjacent virtual PEs across partition cuts map to the **same** physical PE so boundary S1 stays local (no extra lattice edges).

Aether H9 remains: LUTRAM context per physical PE. **Not started** until PE grow covers non-line Blueprint (this note) and a co-sim plan exists.

